msgid "新版本构建与发布"
msgstr "Build and publish a release"

msgid "以下以 `4.0.0` 为例。准备 README、构建 Python 包和验证文档都可以在打标签前完成。推送 `v4.0.0` 标签才会触发正式发布。如果只需要在本机生成可分发的桌面程序，可直接按{ref}`桌面离线包教程 <desktop-bundle>`操作。"
msgstr "This guide uses `4.0.0` as an example. Prepare the README, build the Python packages and verify both manuals before tagging. Pushing the `v4.0.0` tag triggers publication. To build a standalone desktop application locally, go directly to {ref}`Build an offline desktop package <desktop-bundle>`."

msgid "准备构建环境"
msgstr "Prepare the build environment"

msgid "按[下载与安装](../resources/install.md)创建应用环境，确认能启动 GUI，且 `ffmpeg` 和 `ffprobe` 可用。在仓库根目录执行以下命令，取得已有标签并安装回归测试、文档和 Python 打包工具。"
msgstr "Follow [Installation and verification](../resources/install.md) to create the application environment. Confirm the GUI starts and both `ffmpeg` and `ffprobe` are available. From the repository root, fetch existing tags and install the regression, documentation and package build tools."

msgid "准备版本内容"
msgstr "Prepare the release content"

msgid "在 `src/mulimgviewer/release_version.py` 将 `__version__` 设为 `\"4.0.0\"`。版本号使用三段数字；前缀 `v` 只写在 Git 标签中。"
msgstr "Set `__version__` to `\"4.0.0\"` in `src/mulimgviewer/release_version.py`. Use three numeric components. The `v` prefix belongs in the Git tag."

msgid "平时将变更说明写在 `CHANGELOG.md` 的 `## 未发布` 下。发布时只需在上述版本文件中填写一次版本号。`--prepare` 会将待发布说明归入该版本，并生成对应的 README。检查模板里的示例与配图后执行以下命令。"
msgstr "Collect release notes under `## 未发布` in `CHANGELOG.md`. Enter the version number only in the version file above. The prepare command moves pending notes into that version and generates its README. Review the examples and images before running the commands."

msgid "版本为 3.9.7 时保留原 README。从 4.0.0 起，脚本会用根目录的 `README.template.md` 生成根目录的 `README.md`。修改新版介绍时编辑模板，再重新生成。"
msgstr "Version 3.9.7 keeps the original README. Starting with 4.0.0, the script generates the root `README.md` from the template. Edit the template and regenerate when changing the release introduction. (`README.template.md` → `README.md`)"

msgid "检查是否可以提交"
msgstr "Check whether the candidate is ready to commit"

msgid "在无显示器的 Linux 构建机上，安装 Xvfb 和 xauth 后运行 `xvfb-run -a python tools/release.py --full`。检查使用当前 Python 运行 GUI 回归测试。单独安装了 Sphinx 时，可用 `SPHINX_PYTHON` 指定文档环境的 Python 可执行文件。"
msgstr "On a headless Linux builder, install Xvfb and xauth and run `xvfb-run -a python tools/release.py --full`. GUI regression tests run with the current Python interpreter. If Sphinx is installed separately, set `SPHINX_PYTHON` to the documentation environment’s Python executable."

msgid "依次检查本地标签是否已占用、清单中的各语言文档能否严格构建、全量回归是否通过，再生成 wheel 和源码包并核对版本。看到 `Local checks passed for v4.0.0` 后，打开以下结果核对。"
msgstr "The script checks for an existing local tag, builds every registered manual with warnings treated as errors, runs strict regression tests, then builds and validates the Python distributions. After `Local checks passed for v4.0.0`, review these outputs."

msgid "每种语言的手册位于 `docs/_build/release-<code>/index.html`。例如日语为 `docs/_build/release-ja/index.html`。"
msgstr "Open `docs/_build/release-<code>/index.html` for each language, for example `docs/_build/release-ja/index.html` for Japanese."

msgid "`auto_test_scripts/reports/latest.json` 指向本次回归报告目录。打开其中的 `report.html` 查看失败、跳过及运行环境。"
msgstr "`auto_test_scripts/reports/latest.json` points to the most recent regression report directory. Open its `report.html` to review failures, skips and the test environment."

msgid "`build/release-4.0.0/dist/` 包含供 Python 安装的 `.whl` 和源码 `.tar.gz`。需要双击启动的用户请使用下一步的桌面离线包。"
msgstr "`build/release-4.0.0/dist/` contains the installable Python wheel and source archive. For users who want a desktop launcher, build the offline packages in the next step."

msgid "如果提示 README 过期，重新运行 `--prepare`；如果提示同名标签已存在，先核对版本号。文档或测试失败时，按输出定位问题，修复后重新执行 `--full`。"
msgstr "For a stale README, rerun `--prepare`. If the tag already exists, check the version number. For a documentation or test failure, fix the reported issue and rerun `--full`."

msgid "验证将要分发的提交"
msgstr "Verify the commit you intend to distribute"

msgid "将版本文件、模板、生成的 README、发布说明和对应源码一起提交。推送待发布分支，核对该提交的 CI 和回归报告。需要分发离线包时，在 **Actions → Desktop packages → Run workflow** 选该分支，核对运行记录的提交 SHA，再下载各平台产物。"
msgstr "Commit the version file, template, generated README, release notes and corresponding source together. Push the candidate branch and review CI and the regression report for that commit. For offline packages, select the branch in **Actions → Desktop packages → Run workflow**, verify the run’s commit SHA and download the platform artifacts."

msgid "打标签并核对发布结果"
msgstr "Tag the verified commit and check publication"

msgid "以下命令会触发正式发布。先用 `git rev-parse HEAD` 确认当前提交就是通过 CI 并用于打包的提交；如果经过合并或变基后 SHA 改变，应核对最终提交的检查结果。"
msgstr "The following commands trigger a public release. Use `git rev-parse HEAD` to confirm the current commit matches the one verified by CI and used for packaging. If merging or rebasing changed the SHA, review the checks for the final commit."

msgid "在 GitHub Actions 核对标签对应的构建和发布任务。三个系统的 Python 构建成功后，工作流从 CHANGELOG 提取说明，将 Python 分发包上传至 GitHub Release 和 PyPI。维护者需在仓库配置有效的 `PYPI_API_TOKEN`。桌面离线归档由独立工作流生成；在同一 Release 的附件中上传已验收的归档。"
msgstr "Check the build and publication jobs for the tag in GitHub Actions. After Python builds pass on all three systems, the workflow extracts the release notes from the changelog and publishes the Python distributions to GitHub Releases and PyPI. The repository requires a valid `PYPI_API_TOKEN` for PyPI. Desktop archives come from a separate workflow. Attach the verified archives to the same release."

msgid "按{ref}`桌面离线包教程 <desktop-bundle>`核对目标平台和架构，解开下载的归档。在每个目标系统实际启动该包，用[示例视频](../resources/usage.md)检查并排播放，导出后重新打开结果，再将这份产物作为发布附件。"
msgstr "Use the {ref}`desktop bundle guide <desktop-bundle>` to check the target platform and architecture, then extract the downloaded archive. Launch the package on each target system, verify side-by-side playback with the [sample clips](../resources/usage.md), export and reopen a result, and attach that tested artifact to the release."

msgid "[多语言维护教程](localization.md)包括界面译表、完整手册、回归检查和 Read the Docs 发布流程。"
msgstr "The [translation guide](localization.md) covers desktop catalogs, complete manuals, regression checks and publication on Read the Docs."

msgid "发布门槛包括三平台分发包检查和同一标签的 Windows 严格回归。"
msgstr "Publication requires distribution checks on all three platforms and strict Windows regression tests on the same tag."
